# CQRS

Layout: `Features/{Area}/{Commands|Queries}/{UseCase}/{UseCase}Command|Query.cs` + `*Handler.cs` + optional `*Validator.cs`.

```csharp
public sealed record CreateXCommand(XCreateDto Dto) : IRequest<ApiResponse<XDetailDto>>;
```

- Register via `AddFgsApplicationLayer` / `AddFgsFoundation` (`ValidationBehavior`, `LoggingBehavior`).
- FluentValidation `AbstractValidator<T>` on commands; pipeline throws `ValidationException`.
- HTTP handlers return `ApiResponse<T>`. Consumer handlers may return `Task`.
- Writes: `I{Entity}WriteService` + `IUnitOfWork`. Reads: dedicated `I{Entity}ReadRepository` (Setup uses Dapper).
- Clone `TechTrades` (Setup) or `Users` (User) or `Assets` (Asset).
